DTEND:20261114T191500Z
SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:15pm\, 6:15pm\nThirty-four days before she's sent to 
 prison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invites a skept
 ical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an intimate port
 rait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year journey into 
 the abyss.\nhttps://www.imagescinema.org/movie/you-can-see-everything\nFro
 m Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/you-can-see-everything
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b9758215bf050473354a56450ded9f11bfdac44a@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261114T153123Z
DTSTART:20261114T173000Z
DTEND:20261114T193000Z
SUMMARY:Wild Horse Nine
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:30pm\, 3:45pm\, 6:30pm\, 9:45pm\nShortly before the 1
 973 Chilean coup\, CIA agents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago t
 o Easter Island by their bureau chief\, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic st
 atues\, and as the longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and pre
 sent conspiracies\, Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious studen
 ts threatens to send everyone’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\n
 https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/wild-horse-nine\nFrom Pushpin Western M
 ass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/wild-horse-nine
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
