DTEND:20261114T223000Z
SUMMARY:Godzilla Minus Zero
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:War reduced Japan to zero\, and Godzilla plunged it into minus.
  Two years have passed since then\, and the country has faced agonizing st
 ruggles to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life. Just as hu
 manity managed to cling to a hard-won peace\, a new threat strikes\, crush
 ing hope in an instant.\nhttps://www.imagescinema.org/movie/godzilla-minus
 -zero\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/godzilla-minus-zero
END:VEVENT
