SUMMARY:Karaoke Night
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Sing your heart out each and every Thursday starting at 8pm at 
 the Images Cinema Lounge. No need to buy a ticket\, just come by\, sign up
  on the clipboard\, and we take care of the rest. If you want to be the ho
 st for an upcoming karaoke\, send an email to andrew@ Hosts get to introdu
 ce singers\, encourage people to sign up for a song\, and (if they want to
 ) suggest a theme for the night.\nhttps://www.imagescinema.org/movie/karao
 ke-night\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/karaoke-night
