DTSTART:20261204T213000Z
DTEND:20261204T233000Z
SUMMARY:Fjord
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 4:30pm\, 7:30pm\nFollowing the deaths of Mihai's parents
 \, Mihai and Lisbet Gheorghiu leave their life behind in Romania and move 
 with their children to a remote village in Norway\, hoping to rebuild thei
 r lives near Lisbet's family. There\, they grow close to their neighbors\,
  the Halbergs\, whose warmth gives them hope for a fresh start. But the fr
 agile peace begins to unravel when the Gheorghiu family’s young daughter
 \, Elia\, arrives at school covered in bruises.\nhttps://www.imagescinema.
 org/movie/fjord\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma
 /
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/fjord
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5964a59edd169ef7d2bb904bf8e1fc9db2511ed1@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261114T153123Z
DTSTART:20261204T214500Z
DTEND:20261204T234500Z
SUMMARY:Wicker
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 4:45pm\, 7:15pm\, 9:30pm\nOn the outskirts of a village 
 by the sea\, lives a Fisherwoman\; smelly\, single and perpetually ridicul
 ed. One day\, fed up with her stuffy\, small-minded neighbours\, she commi
 ssions herself a husband to be made from wicker. In an otherwise conservat
 ive town\, this unconventional romance sparks outrage\, jealousy and chaos
 .\nhttps://www.imagescinema.org/movie/wicker\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: h
 ttps://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/wicker
END:VEVENT
